{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChUuUYkgUBL4jb1sPL3TE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A conflict round with a clean trial merge no longer starts an agent. The controller merges main into the branch itself, pushes it, and closes the round as done. `go test ./internal/worker/` passes and `go vet ./internal/worker/` is clean.\n\n- **Merge and close-out:** the new `cleanMergeRound` in `internal/worker/cleanmerge.go` runs the same diff guard and code lane as other rounds. It pushes with the fetched main tip as the second parent and updates the PR. It closes out with a controller-written summary through the existing no-agent `Reopened` path, so no role file is needed and no agent job is created.\n- **Push failures:** a branch that moved or a transient push error ends the round the way other push failures do. The tests confirm no agent runs in those cases.\n- **Tests:** I updated `TestConflictRoundCleanMerge` and added `TestConflictRoundCleanMergePushes` and `TestConflictRoundCleanMergePushFailures`. The pushes test asserts no executor job, one commit request whose merge parent is the main tip and whose base is the branch tip, and the `worker.conflict_clean_merge` log event.\n- **Docs:** I added one sentence to the conflict-round paragraph in `docs/proposal.md`.\n\n- **Branch with no changes of its own:** if the clean merge leaves the branch with no changes against main, the round ends needs-human with a hold. The code lane rejects a merge with zero files, so there is nothing to push.\n- **Protected-path case:** I did not write a dedicated test for a clean merge that touches a protected path, such as `.github/`. It goes through the existing guard and committer rules.\n\nThe report is in `.ard/467/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":761,"cache_read_input_tokens":65645,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":761},"output_tokens":572,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0fcb235-0909-46d2-95ab-b8576bee946a","uuid":"ac8c159d-05fd-4932-a276-9a170585f9cb","timestamp":"2026-11-28T07:08:35.592Z","request_id":"req_011ChUuUYbWXfyeUSdpJA7Pa"}
